{"id":"n15648-2-7","stage":2,"title":"빼앗기다 · 被夺走","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15648-2-7-1","ko":"보고서는 아직 멀었어요?","zh":"报告还远没写完吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보고서는","meaning":"报告书","explanation":"보고서：报告书；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"보고서","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59656","senseId":"1","lemma":"보고서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고서는","audio":"/audio/54c0f25affd77afb87b5.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"멀었어요?","meaning":"还早，还不到","explanation":"멀다：还早，还不到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"멀다","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26833","senseId":"4","lemma":"멀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멀었어요","audio":"/audio/33304031702e1d4a5201.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01a64adf7f150065","term":"보고서","zh":"报告书","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3","entryId":"59656","definition":"告知研究、调查内容或结果的文件或文章。","pronunciation":["보ː고서"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"e6d01e903c854714","term":"멀다","zh":"还早，还不到","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3","entryId":"26833","definition":"到现在还剩较长一段时间；尚需很长时间。","pronunciation":["멀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/49bb35b4c288bbf96da4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15648-2-7-2","ko":"죄송해요, 자료 정리에 시간을 너무 많이 빼앗겼어요.","zh":"对不起，我花了太多时间整理资料。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송해요,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송해요","audio":"/audio/e9f7fd1f9febb8b27ec0.mp3"}},{"text":"자료","meaning":"资料","explanation":"자료：资料。","readings":[{"term":"자료","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62401","senseId":"1","lemma":"자료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자료","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3"}},{"text":"정리에","meaning":"整理，收拾，清理","explanation":"정리：整理，收拾，清理；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"정리","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75781","senseId":"1","lemma":"정리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정리에","audio":"/audio/76473f638168703772c9.mp3"}},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"4","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간을","audio":"/audio/ef64a5c202c601ff5d8d.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"빼앗겼어요.","meaning":"被夺走，被抢走","explanation":"빼앗기다：被夺走，被抢走；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"빼앗기다","audio":"/audio/f0cee900853e94496385.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15648","senseId":"2","lemma":"빼앗기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼앗겼어요","audio":"/audio/476b9d55712635d6f5a5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"6416867e47259489","term":"자료","zh":"资料","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3","entryId":"62401","definition":"做研究或调查最基本的材料。","pronunciation":["자료"]},{"id":"829a277fc72022a6","term":"정리","zh":"整理，收拾，清理","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3","entryId":"75781","definition":"将处于散乱状态的东西归整到一起或扔掉。","pronunciation":["정ː니"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"某件事从开始到结束的间隔期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"f0cee900853e9449","term":"빼앗기다","zh":"被夺走，被抢走","audio":"/audio/f0cee900853e94496385.mp3","entryId":"15648","definition":"被强制地失去工作、时间及资格等。","pronunciation":["빼앋끼다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a511d7b110189bf82a8a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.33,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15648","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":74,"sequenceScore":2.0553,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["报告还远没写完吗？","对不起，我花了太多时间整理资料。","你也买了模型飞机吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["报告还远没写完吗？","对不起，我花了太多时间整理资料。","你也买了模型飞机吗？"],"answer":1}]}
